[{"name":"OpenArm 01: Release No.2","uuid":"255609262","tag_name":"1.1","target_commitish":"main","body":"We're excited to announce our second release of OpenArm 01, an update focused on improving the **hardware reliability**, **teleoperation stack**, **assembly clarity**, and **vendor transparency**. This release addresses multiple community-reported issues and feedback: \r\n\r\n## 🚀 Summary of Fixes and Improvements\r\n\r\n| Category | Improvement | Problem | Solution | Issue |\r\n|----------|-------------|---------|----------|-------|\r\n| `Controls` | **Zero-position Calibration** | Manual calibration process was prone to human errors. | Implemented automated zero-position calibration to simplify setup and improve accuracy. | [#323](https://github.com/enactic/openarm/issues/323) |\r\n| `Data Collection` | **Camera Mount** | No official CAD for camera mounts. Users had to design their own mount for Realsense cameras. | Added a **modular camera mount base** with standard mounts designed for **Realsense D435 (chest camera)** and **D405 (wrist camera)**, enabling consistent and reproducible data collection setups. | [#307](https://github.com/enactic/openarm/issues/307) |\r\n| `Hardware` | **Leader-side J5 Casing Cover** | For 7-DoF arms, controlling the elbow was difficult — the operator could only manipulate the end effector, causing ambiguity from redundant joint angles. | Redesigned the **J5 casing** and added a **rubber band interface**, improving coupling between operator and arm for smoother 7-DoF motion control. The elbow can now follow the operator's motion naturally. | [#308](https://github.com/enactic/openarm/issues/308) |\r\n| `Hardware` | **Enhanced J2 Wiring and Cover** | J2 motor cables frequently got caught on the **bolt heads** of the L-shaped J2–J3 connector, risking damage and restricted motion. | Re-routed **J2 wiring** directly out through the rear backplate and modified the cover design to eliminate snag points, improving reliability and cable lifespan. | [#309](https://github.com/enactic/openarm/issues/309) |\r\n| `Hardware` | **PCB Hub Case** | PCB hub was previously exposed, leaving connectors vulnerable to stress and disconnection during operation. | Added a **dedicated PCB hub enclosure** that protects connectors, improves mechanical stability, and simplifies cable organization. | [#310](https://github.com/enactic/openarm/issues/310) |\r\n| `Docs` | **Wiring \u0026 Casing** | Assembly instructions for wire harnessing were unclear, causing confusion about cable routing and casing order. | Added **step-by-step assembly visuals**, diagrams, and improved explanations for wire routing and casing installation. | [#312](https://github.com/enactic/openarm/issues/312) |\r\n| `Docs` | **Purchase Page** | Users faced confusion due to multiple vendors producing OpenArm at varying quality levels, with no clear guidance on where to buy. | Introduced an official [**Purchase Page**](https://docs.openarm.dev/purchase) listing **Official** and **Certified** vendors worldwide to ensure transparency and consistent manufacturing quality. | [#313](https://github.com/enactic/openarm/issues/313) |\r\n\r\n\u003cp align=\"center\"\u003e\r\n  \u003cimg src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6f8e062-7029-4ef7-9d2e-69112bc4b0ef\" alt=\"PXL_20251028_051400096\" width=\"40%\"\u003e\r\n\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n# 💬 Feedback\r\nWe'd love your feedback!  \r\n\r\nIf you encounter any issues or have suggestions, please [open an issue](https://github.com/enactic/openarm/issues) or start a discussion on our Discord server.\r\n\r\n**Thank you for being part of the OpenArm community.**  \r\nYour continued testing, feedback, and collaboration make this project better with every release.\r\n\r\nOpenArm team","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"immutable":false,"published_at":"2025-10-31T11:41:47.000Z","created_at":"2025-10-31T13:13:30.949Z","author":"hiroyams","assets":[],"last_synced_at":"2026-08-06T02:17:10.452Z","html_url":"https://github.com/enactic/openarm/releases/tag/1.1","release_url":"https://repos.ecosyste.ms/api/v1/hosts/GitHub/repositories/enactic%2Fopenarm/releases/1.1","tag_url":"https://repos.ecosyste.ms/api/v1/hosts/GitHub/repositories/enactic%2Fopenarm/tags/1.1"}]